## FHIR API

MedSync provides a FHIR R4 compliant API for standardized healthcare data exchange.

**Base URL**: `https://fhir.medsync.health/r4`

### Supported Resources

| Resource | Operations |
|----------|------------|
| Patient | CRUD, Search |
| Practitioner | Read, Search |
| Organization | Read, Search |
| Encounter | CRUD, Search |
| Condition | CRUD, Search |
| Observation | CRUD, Search |
| CarePlan | CRUD, Search |
| Task | CRUD, Search |
| ServiceRequest | CRUD, Search |
| DocumentReference | CRUD, Search |

### SMART on FHIR

MedSync supports SMART on FHIR for EHR-launched applications.

**Capabilities**:
- EHR Launch
- Standalone Launch
- Patient Context
- Practitioner Context
- Refresh Tokens

