## Webhooks

MedSync can send real-time notifications via webhooks.

### Available Events

| Event | Description |
|-------|-------------|
| patient.created | New patient created |
| patient.updated | Patient record updated |
| task.created | New task created |
| task.completed | Task marked complete |
| referral.received | Incoming referral |
| referral.status_changed | Referral status update |
| care_plan.activated | Care plan activated |
| alert.triggered | Clinical alert fired |

### Webhook Payload

```json
{
  "id": "evt_abc123",
  "type": "task.completed",
  "timestamp": "2025-01-17T15:30:00Z",
  "data": {
    "taskId": "tsk_xyz789",
    "patientId": "pat_abc123",
    "completedBy": "usr_def456",
    "completedAt": "2025-01-17T15:29:58Z"
  },
  "organizationId": "org_medsync"
}
```

### Webhook Security

- Signature verification via `X-MedSync-Signature` header
- IP allowlist available for Enterprise tier
- Retry logic: 3 attempts with exponential backoff

